<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the steady state, and the k_c formula, and each is implemented under a named function. Lean theorems in MathOfBiology.Loop_3139 encode the same sign conditions. Deducted because the pass-1 figure's text panel, rather than a cited equation number in Murray, carries the coat-scale comparison." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script implements Schnakenberg kinetics, the homogeneous Jacobian, and the Turing determinant formula for k_c, then integrates them with a Fourier operator split on a periodic patch. Clip bounds are present and recorded a hit fraction of 0 on the audited run, so they did not move the trajectory. Deducted because the physical diffusivities use a reconstructed 1 s time unit, and because the pass-1 figure does not yet show the equal-diffusion ablation that the self-test checks analytically." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-canis-lupus-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Morphometric validation: 80/100" ;
