    dct:description "measure_morphoeval reports lambda_c, k_c, dispersion Pearson r = 0.9935 against a reference of 1 (not equal), RMSE = 1.002 against 0, saturated k_meas/k_c = 0.976 against 1, activator peak spacing 1.754 µm against 1.781 µm, and segmented specimen nearest-neighbour spacing 8.94 px against the model wavelength in micrometres. The pixel spacing is a real segmentation and is deliberately not treated as a micrometre measurement. KS and the control stds are absent from this pass's sidecar." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
