    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 1.781 µm on a Holocene Canis lupus (MDCK) apical patch — Morphological realism / specimen match: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The comparison figure places the canonical Canis lupus micrograph beside the activator lattice and beside the micrograph multiplied by that lattice. The 16-frame GIF ends on that same modulated micrograph and scores CV similarity 96.0. Deducted because the histological polygons are the photograph, not an emergent output of the PDE, and because the micrograph has no scale bar linking those polygons to 1.781 µm." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
